  logText: 'This marked piece was likely some sort of calendar. \n\nSince their planet
    is tidally locked, they probably didn''t have a concept of days. The colours
    suggest that they may have used the rise and fall of tides caused by their moon.\n\nWhile
    we can''t figure out the exact dates, with this new information MIRA might be
    able to make an approximate estimation of the order in which the documents were
    written. '
